  7940→
  7941→      ## Tasks
  7942→
  7943→
  7944→      derive_from_specs: true
  7945→
  7946→
  7947→      ### Implementation Notes
  7948→
  7949→
  7950→      #### ui-design-system
  7951→
  7952→      Set up the isolated clone first. Port imgen's full token-contract.css into
  7953→
  7954→      Tailwind @theme inline in app.css. Start with the token bridge pilot on the
  7955→
  7956→      dashboard page to validate the approach before touching other views. Create
  7957→
  7958→      tokens.css, animations.css, typography.css in lib/ds/. Establish loading
  7959→
  7960→      skeleton and error boundary patterns.
  7961→
  7962→
  7963→      #### ui-app-shell
  7964→
  7965→      Restructure +layout.svelte with new sidebar component. Migrate existing
  7966→
  7967→      Sidebar.svelte to grouped navigation. Add /items -> /specs redirect.
  7968→
  7969→      Fix Observations nav visibility bug. Migrate taskDetailStore from Svelte 4
  7970→
  7971→      to Svelte 5 runes. Consolidate three existing task detail implementations.
  7972→
  7973→      Ensure all existing routes still work.
  7974→
  7975→
  7976→      #### ui-task-board
  7977→
  7978→      Prerequisite: daemon must return type and automation in task list API response
  7979→
  7980→      (quick fix to packages/daemon/src/routes/tasks.ts). Add needs_work to status
  7981→
  7982→      color/label maps. Build KanbanBoard, KanbanColumn, TaskCard, TaskDetailModal,
  7983→
  7984→      ActiveFleetRow components. Wire to tasks:updates WebSocket topic. Build task
  7985→
  7986→      mutation endpoints in daemon (submit, complete, block) for detail modal actions.
  7987→
  7988→
  7989→      #### ui-session-stream
  7990→
  7991→      Prerequisite: build GET /api/sessions and GET /api/sessions/:id/events daemon
  7992→
  7993→      endpoints. Two-tier rendering: structured events from events.jsonl for history,
  7994→
  7995→      agent_text_chunk WS for live text. Build SessionStream, ChatMessage,
  7996→
  7997→      ToolCallView, ThinkingBlock components. Implement auto-scroll with pause/resume.
  7998→
  7999→      Port patterns from kynetic-internal's ChatPanel.
  8000→
  8001→
  8002→      #### ui-agent-dispatch
  8003→
  8004→      Uses existing GET /api/agent/dispatch/status and GET /api/agent/status endpoints.
  8005→
  8006→      Subscribe to agents WS topic for real-time updates. Build AgentList,
  8007→
  8008→      DispatchStatus, InvocationCard components.
  8009→
  8010→
  8011→      #### ui-session-history
  8012→
  8013→      Depends on GET /api/sessions endpoint from ui-session-stream work.
  8014→
  8015→      Build SessionList with filtering. Link to session stream view.
  8016→
  8017→
  8018→      #### ui-inbox-enhanced
  8019→
  8020→      Enhance existing inbox view. Add triage status from existing triage API.
  8021→
  8022→      Add filter controls. Keep existing add/delete functionality.
  8023→
  8024→
  8025→      #### ui-plans-view
  8026→
  8027→      Prerequisite: build GET /api/plans daemon endpoint (wrap existing loadAllPlans).
  8028→
  8029→      Build PlanList with progress calculation from linked task statuses.
  8030→
  8031→
  8032→      #### ui-validation-view
  8033→
  8034→      Uses existing GET /api/validate and GET /api/alignment endpoints.
  8035→
  8036→      Build ValidationSummary, AlignmentStats, IssueList components.
  8037→
  8038→
  8039→      #### ui-dashboard-overview
  8040→
  8041→      Build last. Uses data from tasks, inbox, observations, validation APIs.
  8042→
  8043→      Active work section reuses ActiveFleetRow from task board.
  8044→
  8045→      No aggregated activity API needed — merge recent data client-side.
